comments.content:
**Duplicated scan-and-iterate pattern across all six predicates.**

The following pattern is repeated verbatim in P1, P2, P4, P5, and P6:
```ts
for (const file of anchor.files) {
  const text = windowText(ctx, file); if (text === undefined) continue;
  if (!/...pattern.../.test(text)) continue;
  const lines = text.split('\n');
  for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) if (/...line-pattern.../.test(lines[i] ?? '')) {
    const win = lines.slice(...).join('\n');
    // detection logic
  }
}
```
Extracting a shared `scanAnchoredFiles(ctx, anchor, fileGuard, lineGuard, windowFn, findingFactory)` helper would reduce each predicate to its unique detection logic, making future F-XXX fixes (like F-840, F-47, F-1050) less error-prone and easier to audit.

